[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12541.99, "timestamp": "03:29:01", "text": "所以，玩点别的吧。什么鬼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12545.59, "timestamp": "03:29:05", "text": "我们可以用什么游戏来对抗火炬？什么可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12547.87, "timestamp": "03:29:07", "text": "我们与火炬队比赛，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12551.99, "timestamp": "03:29:11", "text": "坦克？嗯，奇异博士挺不错的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12555.269, "timestamp": "03:29:15", "text": "毒液什么也做不了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12561.349, "timestamp": "03:29:21", "text": "好吧，手电筒会很烦人。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12571.91, "timestamp": "03:29:31", "text": "夏洛克很会玩弄权术，而我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12577.19, "timestamp": "03:29:37", "text": "如果他们从侧翼包抄，我会牢记在心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12599.269, "timestamp": "03:29:59", "text": "打破了护盾。根本不存在"}]